OL,3,AFind out who's in the running for this
OL,4,Ayear's Booker Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut seven books that appeared on the
OL,7,Flonglist in July were jettisoned, and
OL,8,FDame Mary Beard, who chaired the
OL,9,Fjudging panel, said agreeing on the
OL,10,Ffinal six "has been, to put it mildly,
OL,11,Fhard work".
